# Normaliza quebras de linha no repositorio.
# Arquivos de texto: LF no repo, CRLF no checkout do Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Scripts Unix precisam de LF e permissao de execucao.
*.sh text eol=lf
run.sh text eol=lf

# Script do Windows precisa de CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
run.bat text eol=crlf

# Binarios.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary

# GitHub linguist.
*.md linguist-documentation
docs/* linguist-documentation
